{"t": 1794116186.510992, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout.promo.normalize_code` (`checkout/promo.py`).\n\n`normalize_code` now strips surrounding whitespace, removes inner whitespace, and upper-cases the code before lookup:\n\n```python\ndef normalize_code(code: str) -> str:\n    return \"\".join(code.split()).upper()\n```\n\nVerified locally: `' autumn24 '`, `'  autumn 24 '`, `'Autumn 24'` and `'AUTUMN24'` all normalise to `AUTUMN24`.\n\nRoot cause: Sentry issue CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q (`PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist`, os=Android 15, app=android 8.2, 2,940 events) \u2014 Android keyboards add surrounding/inner spaces and lower-case input, which was passed to the lookup unchanged.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
